    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Concrete Spaces is an interactive poetry collection,\u00a0that plays with creating and destroying spatial expectations, spoken word inspired pacing, and bilinguality.</i>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 interactive audiovisual poems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implied, yet completely unforced linearity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mainly written in English, with some Finnish texts in the mix. (can be fully experienced without understanding the language)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single playthrough taking 20-40 minutes, depending on your pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optionless; windowed mode and keyboard input only.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These alt-games, art games, kill-gameplay-games, or whatever you'd like to call them, aren't exactly made to act as time-sinks \u2501 so if you're looking for that sort of stuff, this might not be for you... As this game was solo developed, there's still a possibility for bugs, if encountered, reload the currently open Space! Thanks.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Concrete Spaces is an interactive poetry collection,\u00a0that plays with creating and destroying spatial expectations, spoken word inspired pacing, and bilinguality.</i>    </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 interactive audiovisual poems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Implied, yet completely unforced linearity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mainly written in English, with some Finnish texts in the mix. (can be fully experienced without understanding the language)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single playthrough taking 20-40 minutes, depending on your pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optionless; windowed mode and keyboard input only.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These alt-games, art games, kill-gameplay-games, or whatever you'd like to call them, aren't exactly made to act as time-sinks \u2501 so if you're looking for that sort of stuff, this might not be for you... As this game was solo developed, there's still a possibility for bugs, if encountered, reload the currently open Space! Thanks.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
